{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03889","headline":"祭汾阴乐章 · 崔玄童","name":"祭汾阴乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"聿修严配，展事禋宗。\n祥符宝鼎，礼备黄琮。\n祝词以信，明德惟聪。\n介兹景福，永永无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔玄童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}